#: ../../404.rst:6
msgid "File Not Found (404)"
msgstr "Datoteka ni najdena (404)"

#: ../../404.rst:11
msgid "This page does not exist."
msgstr "Ta stran ne obstaja."

#: ../../404.rst:13
msgid "This might be because of the following:"
msgstr "To je morda zaradi naslednjega:"

#: ../../404.rst:15
msgid ""
"We moved the manual from MediaWiki to Sphinx and with that came a lot of "
"reorganization."
msgstr ""
"Priročnik smo preselili iz MediaWiki v Sphinx in s tem je prišlo veliko "
"reorganizacije."

#: ../../404.rst:16
msgid "The page has been deprecated."
msgstr "Ta stran je opuščena."

#: ../../404.rst:17
msgid "Or a simple typo in the URL."
msgstr "Ali preprosta napaka v URL-ju."

#: ../../404.rst:19
msgid ""
"In all cases, you might be able to find the page you're looking for by using "
"the search in the left hand navigation."
msgstr ""
"V vseh primerih lahko poiščete stran, ki jo iščete, tako, da uporabite "
"iskanje v vrstici za krmarjenje na levi strani."
